lottie.min.js is a vendored, unmodified copy of the lottie-web "light" player.

  Project: lottie-web (https://github.com/airbnb/lottie-web)
  Version: 5.12.2
  Build:   build/player/lottie_light.min.js
  License: MIT

It renders the animated (.tgs) stickers in the chat view. TGS is a
gzip-compressed, expression-free Lottie subset, which the light build plays.

